{"pull": {"id": "number:18702", "number": 18702, "title": "KAFKA-18645: New consumer should align close timeout handling with classic consumer", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2025-01-25T06:58:27Z", "closed_at": "2025-02-05T14:08:51Z", "merged_at": "2025-02-05T14:08:51Z", "user": {"login": "frankvicky", "id": 51072200, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDcyMjAw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51072200?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky", "html_url": "https://github.com/frankvicky", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "JIRA: KAFKA-18645\r\nsee discussion:\r\nhttps://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/18590#issuecomment-2612654505\r\n\r\nIn the classic consumer, the timeout respects `request.timeout.ms`. However, in the async consumer, this logic is either missing or only applies to individual requests. Unlike the classic consumer, where `request.timeout.ms` works for the entire coordinator closing behavior, the async implementation handles timeouts differently.\r\n\r\nWe should align the close timeout-handling to enable `ConsumerBounceTest#testClose`\r\n\r\n### Committer Checklist (excluded from commit message)\r\n- [ ] Verify design and implementation \r\n- [ ] Verify test coverage and CI build status\r\n- [ ] Verify documentation (including upgrade notes)\r\n", "labels": [{"id": 838330122, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4MzgzMzAxMjI=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/core", "name": "core", "color": "ed5a86", "default": false, "description": "Kafka Broker", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 851033232, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4NTEwMzMyMzI=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/consumer", "name": "consumer", "color": "bf6a03", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7491388177, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABvoWDEQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/clients", "name": "clients", "color": "ededed", "default": false, "description": null, "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7522931565, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwGbTbQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/ci-approved", "name": "ci-approved", "color": "ffffff", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7559660738, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwpdEwg", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/small", "name": "small", "color": "FEF2C0", "default": false, "description": "Small PRs", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/18702"}, "reviews": [], "review_comments": [], "issue_comments": [], "commits": [], "files": [], "timeline": [], "_partial": "search", "_source": "extra-data/github-search/author_frankvicky_is_pr.json"}